        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "An advantage of this approach is that we believe a single drug candidate can be developed to target several energy metabolism and redox pathways in both glial and neuronal cells at once, which has been supported by our nonclinical pharmacological studies and clinical trials of our lead asset, CNM-Au8®, a catalytically-active gold nanocrystal suspension.",
